 995:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_comp.c ****   *           - Comparator output is low when the input plus is at a lower
 996:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_comp.c ****   *             voltage than the input minus
 997:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_comp.c ****   *           - Comparator output is high when the input plus is at a higher
 998:Drivers/STM32G4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32g4xx_hal_comp.c ****   *             voltage than the input minus
